  'UITS Bus Tracking – Privacy Policy\n\n'
            'Last updated: September 2025\n\n'
            'UITS Bus Tracking is an official application of the University of Information Technology and Sciences (UITS) designed to help students and staff view routes, track active buses, and plan campus transit efficiently.\n\n'
            '1. Information We Collect\n'
            '- Location: If you opt-in to share your live location (e.g., when a driver or authorized staff shares bus location), we collect and transmit device coordinates to display bus movement on the map.\n'
            '- Device & App Info: Basic diagnostics (app version, device model, OS) may be used to improve stability and performance.\n'
            '- Usage Data: Anonymous interaction data (e.g., screen views) may be used to understand app usage patterns.\n\n'
            '2. How We Use Your Information\n'
            '- To display real-time bus positions and route information.\n'
            '- To improve reliability, security, and user experience.\n'
            '- To send important notifications (e.g., service alerts), if you enable notifications.\n\n'
            '3. Data Sharing\n'
            '- We do not sell personal data.\n'
            '- Data may be shared with UITS-authorized service providers strictly to operate core features (e.g., maps, notifications).\n\n'
            '4. Location Permissions\n'
            '- Foreground location is required to show your position on the map and for authorized live sharing.\n'
            '- Background location (if enabled) is used only for continuous sharing by authorized roles and can be turned off anytime.\n\n'
            '5. Data Retention\n'
            '- Transient location updates for live tracking are stored only as needed. Aggregated or anonymized data may be retained for service analytics.\n\n'
            '6. Third-Party Services\n'
            '- Google Maps is used to render maps and directions.\n'
            '- Notification services (e.g., OneSignal/Firebase) may be used for alerts, subject to their respective privacy policies.\n\n'
            '7. Your Choices\n'
            '- You can disable location sharing at any time.\n'
            '- You can revoke notification permissions from system settings.\n\n'
            '8. Security\n'
            '- We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data. No system can be 100% secure.\n\n'
            '9. Contact\n'
            'For questions or requests (access, correction, deletion), please contact the UITS authority.\n\n'
            'By using this app, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
